# [P1] Lemma 38 (d = 3), derived by rule applications: a W node with one output on the pink
# dot effect is the identity, here the phaseless Z spider with two legs (COMPLETENESS.txt, 7).

@rhs =
    z = Z(1 -> 1, literal 3)

w = W(1 -> 2, literal 3); e = X(1 -> 0, literal 3); wire w.out1 -- e.in0; scalar 3^(-1/2)
apply w_zero_effect
apply zxw_s2_converse at 0
apply w_identity
prove against @rhs
certificate emit derivation
certificate kernel
